        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "description": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Real node-exporter measurements from this server. **N/A means telemetry is unavailable.** Load is runnable/blocked work, not CPU utilization. The monitoring stack is local; a complete host outage needs an external monitor."
      }
    },
    {
